{"sha": "590a1151aefb412f3590cd34388588e5e1c0fc15397b8f64f54850ddaf4d940c", "body": ["\\begin{remark}\\label{rem:b3:lp:modes}", "$L^p$ 收敛不蕴含几乎处处收敛（", "即\\emph{打字机序列}，见\\cref{exo:b3:lp:3}），反之亦不成立", "（逃逸凸起）：两种收敛仅", "通过子列与控制相联系。牢记", "\\cref{exo:b3:lp:3}中的反例，是最好的“疫苗”。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{稠密性定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:b3:lp:density}", "设 $1 \\leq p < \\infty$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 简单函数（支集具有有限测度）在", "        $L^p(\\mu)$ 中稠密。", "  \\item 在 $L^p(\\R^d)$ 中，连续紧支撑函数", "        类 $\\mathcal C_c(\\R^d)$ 稠密。", "  \\item 平移在 $L^p(\\R^d)$ 上连续：记", "        $\\tau_hf = f(\\cdot - h)$，$\\norm{\\tau_hf - f}_p \\to 0$", "        当 $h \\to 0$ 时。", "\\end{enumerate}", "以上三条对 $p = \\infty$ 均不成立。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "(1) 设 $f \\geq 0$，由", "\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:approximation}中的二进列 $s_n \\nearrow f$ 满足 $\\abs{f - s_n}^p", "\\leq f^p \\in L^1$，由控制收敛定理。（每个 $s_n \\leq f$ 属于 $L^p$，", "其水平集在取值为正处具有有限测度：", "$\\mu(s_n \\geq c) \\leq c^{-p}\\int f^p$。）将", "一般的 $f$ 分解为四个非负部分。", "", "(2) 由 (1)，只需逼近 $\\mathbf 1_A$，其中 $A$ 为 Borel 集，", "且 $\\lambda_d(A) < \\infty$。由正则性（证明同", "\\cref{thm:b3:measure:regularity}）得紧集 $K \\subseteq A", "\\subseteq U$ 为开集，使 $\\lambda_d(U\\setminus K) <", "\\varepsilon$；取乌雷松函数", "\\[", "\\varphi(x) = \\frac{d(x, \\R^d\\setminus U)}{d(x, \\R^d\\setminus U)", "+ d(x, K)}", "\\]", "该函数连续，$1$ 在 $K$ 上，$0$ 在 $U$ 外，", "且可取为紧支撑的（先将 $U$ 缩小为有界开集）。于是有", "$\\norm{\\mathbf 1_A - \\varphi}_p^p \\leq \\lambda_d(U\\setminus K)", "< \\varepsilon$。", "", "(3) 对 $g \\in \\mathcal C_c$，由一致连续性得", "$\\norm{\\tau_hg - g}_\\infty \\to 0$，且支集在", "当 $\\abs h \\leq 1$ 时位于一固定紧集内，故 $\\norm{\\tau_hg - g}_p \\to 0$。对", "一般的 $f$，取 $g \\in \\mathcal C_c$，使 $\\norm{f - g}_p <", "\\varepsilon$；则 $\\norm{\\tau_hf - f}_p \\leq 2\\norm{f - g}_p +", "\\norm{\\tau_hg - g}_p$（范数的平移不变性）。", "", "对 $p = \\infty$，用连续函数一致逼近 $\\mathbf", "1_{\\intoo0\\infty}$ 不可能", "（存在跳跃），且 $\\norm{\\tau_h\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo0\\infty} - \\mathbf", "1_{\\intoo0\\infty}}_\\infty = 1$，当 $h \\neq 0$ 时。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{卷积与正则化}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[杨不等式]\\label{thm:b3:lp:young}", "设 $1 \\leq p \\leq \\infty$，$f \\in L^1(\\R^d)$，$g \\in", "L^p(\\R^d)$。则 $f * g$ 几乎处处有定义，属于 $L^p$，", "且\\index{杨不等式}", "\\[", "\\norm{f * g}_p \\leq \\norm f_1\\,\\norm g_p .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$p = \\infty$：直接估计。$p = 1$：", "由\\cref{thm:b3:product:convolution}。设 $1 < p < \\infty$，$q$", "为其共轭指数。将 $\\abs{f(y)} = \\abs{f(y)}^{1/q}\\cdot", "\\abs{f(y)}^{1/p}$，并应用赫尔德不等式：", "\\[", "\\int\\abs{f(y)}\\,\\abs{g(x{-}y)}\\,\\dd y", "\\leq \\Bigl(\\int\\abs f\\Bigr)^{1/q}", "\\Bigl(\\int\\abs{f(y)}\\,\\abs{g(x - y)}^p\\,\\dd y\\Bigr)^{1/p} .", "\\]", "两边取 $p$ 次方并对 $x$ 积分；对第二个因子应用托内利定理，", "得 $\\norm f_1^{p/q}\\cdot\\norm f_1\\norm g_p^p$，", "即 $\\norm{f*g}_p^p \\leq \\norm f_1^{1 + p/q}\\norm g_p^p =", "(\\norm f_1\\norm g_p)^p$ --- 而托内利积分的有限性", "保证几乎处处绝对收敛，与", "\\cref{thm:b3:product:convolution}中的论证相同。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[磨光子]\\label{def:b3:lp:mollifier}", "函数\\index{磨光子}\\index{凸起函数}", "\\[", "\\rho(x) = \\begin{cases}", "c\\,\\exp\\Bigl(-\\dfrac{1}{1 - \\norm x^2}\\Bigr) & \\norm x < 1,\\\\", "0 & \\norm x \\geq 1,", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "其中常数 $c$ 使 $\\int\\rho = 1$，它是 $\\mathcal C^\\infty$ 函数", "（定义于 $\\R^d$ 上）：关键在于 $t \\mapsto \\eu^{-1/t}\\mathbf", "1_{t>0}$ 为 $\\mathcal C^\\infty$ 函数（在 $\\R$ 上），其各阶导数在", "$0^+$ 处均为 $0$（每个导数形如 $P(1/t)\\eu^{-1/t}$，", "$P$ 为多项式，它趋于 $0$；对阶数用归纳法）。对", "$\\varepsilon > 0$，令 $\\rho_\\varepsilon(x) =", "\\varepsilon^{-d}\\rho(x/\\varepsilon)$，其支集含于 $\\bar B(0,", "\\varepsilon)$ 内，积分仍为 $1$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[正则化]\\label{thm:b3:lp:regularization}", "设 $1 \\leq p < \\infty$，$f \\in L^p(\\R^d)$。则：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $f * \\rho_\\varepsilon \\in \\mathcal C^\\infty(\\R^d)$，", "        且 $\\partial^\\alpha(f * \\rho_\\varepsilon) = f *", "        \\partial^\\alpha\\rho_\\varepsilon$；", "  \\item $\\norm{f * \\rho_\\varepsilon - f}_p \\to 0$，当", "        $\\varepsilon \\to 0$ 时；", "  \\item 因此 $\\mathcal C^\\infty_c(\\R^d)$ 在", "        $L^p(\\R^d)$ 中稠密。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}